ted-graphics\\\",\n      \\\"title\\\": \\\"Visual control tradeoffs in computed graphics\\\",\n      \\\"structure_type\\\": \\\"wiki\\\",\n      \\\"sections\\\": [\n        {\n          \\\"title\\\": \\\"Controls and approximations\\\",\n          \\\"body\\\": \\\"A cross-source page can synthesize how computed graphics systems expose controls that improve visual legibility or variety while accepting artifacts, constraints, or information loss. Skeleton-based edge bundling lets users tune smoothing, relaxation, and cushion shading, but the same method is limited because bundling overdraws individual edges and distorts directions. Crowd rendering similarly uses PCA-informed impostor planes to reduce popping, alpha-channel multipass recoloring to add variation, and shadow projection to preserve posture cues, all within an impostor-based approximation.\\\"\n        },\n        {\n          \\\"title\\\": \\\"Creative extension\\\",\n          \\\"body\\\": \\\"Shadercoding supplies a conceptual parallel: mathematical and technical constraints can become creative motors, and mastery of the code-image system can support live improvisation. The evidence is stronger for technical tradeoffs in edge bundling and crowd rendering than for direct equivalence with performance art, so this topic frames shadercoding as an interpretive extension rather than the core evidence.\\\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \\\"claim_ids\\\": [\n        \\\"claim-smoothing-relaxation-and-cushion-shading-let-users-adjust-whether-bundles-appear--f208f3204963\\\",\n        \\\"claim-skeleton-based-edge-bundling-is-most-appropriate-for-coarse-scale-connectivity-e--14fed4bbcde5\\\",\n        \\\"claim-perturbing-an-impostor-plane-toward-a-pca-derived-best-fitting-plane-reduces-vie--e9f84568a82e\\\",\n        \\\"claim-alpha-channel-multipass-rendering-can-recolor-significant-body-regions-such-as-c--265615107527\\\",\n        \\\"claim-the-same-image-database-used-for-impostors-can-project-posture-consistent-human--625367fc5d02\\\",\n        \\\"claim-mathematical-and-technical-constraints-in-shadercoding-can-become-creative-motor--5b703448e7f5\\\",\n        \\\"claim-mastered-shadercoding-can-support-real-time-artistic-improvisation-that-fuses-co--51c4a707f8d0\\\"\n      ],\n      \\\"source_ids\\\": [\n        \\\"source-03-skeleton-based-edge-bundling-for-graph-visualization--1a3dfa0e6b4c\\\",\n        \\\"source-02-image-based-crowd-rendering--565ae2b0e3a1\\\",\n        \\\"source-01-sphere-tracing-a-geometric-method-for-the-antialiased-ray-tracing-of-implicit-surfaces--eee351440d34\\\"\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n\noutput_path.write_text(json.dumps(payload, ensure_ascii=False, indent=2) + \\\"\\\\n\\\", encoding=\\\"utf-8\\\")\nPY\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
